2025,2025-03-22 06:54,2025-03-22 06:54,AuA-EmJrxK0,UgwypeVh3TukmoY24xd4AaABAg,"chikawa cabeza:
- AM
- 6pb
- 6aum
- 1pb 1aum
- aum 2 pb
- 3pb 1aum X2 3pb (blanco 1aum) 3pb 1aumX3
- 2pb 1aum 2pb X2 2pb (1aum 3pb con blanco) 1pb 1aum (2pb 1aum 2pb)X2
- aum 5pb X2 1aum 1pb (blanco 4pb 1aum 1pb) 4pb (1aun 5pb 1aum) X2
- 3pb 1aum 3pb X2 1pb (blanco 2pb 1aum 6pb 1aum 1pb) 2pb (3pb 1aum 3pb)X2
- ronda 8-14 pb blanco
- 3pb 1dis 3pb
- 1dis 5pb
- 2pb 1dis 2pb
- 1dis 3pb
- 1pb 1dis 1pb
- 1dis 1pb
- 6dis",40,3
