[Chiikawa Movie Exclusive ‘Secret Book’ Revealed!🏝️]

The movie Chiikawa: The Secret of Mermaid Island continues its box-office success, having surpassed 1.2 million moviegoers! ✨

To celebrate its release, the Weekday Bonus for Week 3 has been revealed: the exclusive “Secret Book”!

Inside, you can discover behind-the-scenes stories, character-specific highlights to look out for, and the process behind how The Secret of Mermaid Island came to life, complete with original story illustrations from the time and comments from creator Nagano.

You’ll also find an original “Delicious Honey Diary” available only in the Secret Book, along with a special bonus manga titled “Ode Island”! 👀

The booklet includes both the original Japanese text and a Korean translation, making it easy to enjoy all the special content!

The bonus is available only at participating CGV, Megabox, Lotte Cinema, and CineQ theaters in Korea. 

It can be collected on the same day as your movie screening, after watching the movie, on a first-come, first-served basis!

*Check each cinema’s website or app for participating locations. 🎬


